      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cainsville%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Cainsville lies at the crossroads of Missouri Routes N and V, about seven miles north of Mount Moriah.",
